<title>USA: PartnerRe Ltd switches to NYSE.</title>
<headline>PartnerRe Ltd switches to NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PartnerRe Ltd issued a statement Friday saying its common shares will start trading on the New York Stock Exchange November 7 under the symbol PRE.N.</p>
<p>PartnerRe provides, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Partner Reinsurance Co Ltd, catastrophe reinsurance to insurance companies worldwide. Risks reinsured include windstorm, earthquake, flood, fire and explosion.</p>
